<!doctype html>
<html lang="it">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover">
<meta name="description" content="Trasporto sanitario su voli di linea con barella aeronautica ed equipe medica a bordo. Rimpatri e trasferimenti a medio e lungo raggio, dal reparto di partenza a quello di destinazione.">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#050A14">
<link rel="icon" href="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 64 64'%3E%3Crect width='64' height='64' rx='14' fill='%232E6BE0'/%3E%3Cpath d='M28 12h8v16h16v8H36v16h-8V36H12v-8h16z' fill='white'/%3E%3C/svg%3E">
<meta property="og:type" content="website">
<meta property="og:locale" content="it_IT">
<meta property="og:site_name" content="LifeCare Italia Medical Flights">
<meta property="og:title" content="Ci prendiamo cura dei tuoi cari fino a casa">
<meta property="og:description" content="Trasporto sanitario su voli di linea con barella aeronautica ed equipe medica a bordo. Rimpatri e trasferimenti a medio e lungo raggio, dal reparto di partenza a quello di destinazione.">
<meta property="og:image" content="assets/og.jpg">
<meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image">
<title>Riportarli a casa</title>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Spectral:wght@300;400;600&family=IBM+Plex+Sans:wght@300;400;500;600&family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@400;500&display=swap">
<style>
:root{
  --ink:#050A14;
  --ink-2:#0A1526;
  --navy:#0A2A5E;
  --navy-soft:#12305F;
  --blue:#2E6BE0;
  --sky:#8FB8F2;
  --vital:#4FD1E0;
  --paper:#EEF3FA;
  --mute:#8B9CB8;
  --line:rgba(143,184,242,.16);
  --serif:"Spectral",Georgia,"Times New Roman",serif;
  --sans:"IBM Plex Sans","Helvetica Neue",Arial,sans-serif;
  --mono:"IBM Plex Mono","SF Mono",Menlo,monospace;
  --wrap:1180px;
}
*{box-sizing:border-box}
body{margin:0;background:var(--ink);color:var(--paper);font-family:var(--sans);font-weight:400;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;overflow-x:hidden}
h1,h2,h3{font-family:var(--serif);font-weight:400;text-wrap:balance;margin:0;letter-spacing:-.01em}
p{margin:0}
a{color:inherit}
:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--vital);outline-offset:3px;border-radius:2px}

/* ---------- LOADER ---------- */
#loader{position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:999;background:var(--ink);display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:34px;transition:opacity .9s ease,visibility .9s}
#loader.gone{opacity:0;visibility:hidden}
.ld-mark{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:clamp(30px,5vw,50px);letter-spacing:.01em}
.ld-mark b{font-weight:600;color:var(--blue)}
.ld-mark span{color:var(--paper);font-weight:300}
.ld-sub{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.34em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--mute)}
.ld-rail{width:min(300px,62vw);height:2px;background:rgba(143,184,242,.14);overflow:hidden}
.ld-fill{height:100%;width:0;background:var(--vital);transition:width .25s linear}
.ld-pct{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:13px;color:var(--mute);letter-spacing:.16em;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}

/* ---------- HEADER ---------- */
header{position:fixed;top:0;left:0;right:0;z-index:80;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;padding:20px clamp(18px,4vw,44px);transition:background .4s ease,backdrop-filter .4s ease,border-color .4s ease;border-bottom:1px solid transparent}
header.solid{background:rgba(5,10,20,.82);backdrop-filter:blur(14px);-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(14px);border-bottom-color:var(--line)}
.logo{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:21px;letter-spacing:.01em;text-decoration:none;white-space:nowrap}
.logo b{font-weight:600;color:var(--blue)}
.logo i{font-style:normal;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.26em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--mute);display:block;margin-top:3px}
nav{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:clamp(16px,2.6vw,34px)}
nav a{font-size:15px;letter-spacing:.04em;color:var(--sky);text-decoration:none;transition:color .25s}
nav a:hover{color:var(--paper)}
.cta{font-family:var(--sans);font-size:14.5px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:.04em;padding:12px 22px;border:1px solid var(--blue);color:var(--paper);text-decoration:none;background:rgba(46,107,224,.12);transition:background .25s,border-color .25s}
.cta:hover{background:var(--blue);border-color:var(--blue)}
@media(max-width:820px){nav a:not(.cta){display:none}}

/* ---------- SCROLL CANVAS ---------- */
#film{position:relative;height:760vh}
.pin{position:sticky;top:0;height:100vh;overflow:hidden;background:var(--ink)}
#seq{display:block;width:100%;height:100%}
.vignette{position:absolute;inset:0;pointer-events:none;background:
  linear-gradient(to bottom,rgba(5,10,20,.72) 0%,rgba(5,10,20,0) 26%,rgba(5,10,20,0) 58%,rgba(5,10,20,.86) 100%),
  radial-gradient(120% 80% at 50% 50%,rgba(5,10,20,0) 42%,rgba(5,10,20,.55) 100%)}
.cap{position:absolute;z-index:3;max-width:min(560px,84vw);opacity:0;will-change:opacity,transform;pointer-events:none;padding:38px 46px;text-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(2,6,14,.95),0 2px 18px rgba(2,6,14,.9),0 4px 44px rgba(2,6,14,.8);background:radial-gradient(ellipse 80% 78% at 50% 50%,rgba(2,6,14,.86) 0%,rgba(2,6,14,.72) 40%,rgba(2,6,14,.34) 66%,rgba(2,6,14,0) 84%)}
.cap .eyebrow{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:clamp(17.5px,1.9vw,23px);font-weight:500;letter-spacing:.15em;word-spacing:.3em;line-height:1.75;text-transform:uppercase;color:#93EAF5;text-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(2,6,14,.98),0 2px 16px rgba(2,6,14,.95);margin-bottom:20px}
.cap:not(.center) .eyebrow{font-size:clamp(20px,2.2vw,27px);letter-spacing:.12em;word-spacing:.24em;line-height:1.6;margin-bottom:20px}
.cap h2{font-size:clamp(30px,4.5vw,56px);line-height:1.12}
.cap h1{font-size:clamp(30px,4.9vw,66px);line-height:1.08;letter-spacing:-.015em}
.cap p{margin-top:19px;font-size:clamp(19.5px,2vw,25px);line-height:1.66;color:#F5F9FE;max-width:42ch;font-weight:400}
.cap.center{left:50%;top:50%;transform:translate(-50%,-50%);text-align:center;width:min(820px,92vw);max-width:none}
.cap.center p{margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto}
.cap.left{left:clamp(4px,5vw,86px);top:50%;transform:translateY(-50%)}
.cap.right{right:clamp(4px,5vw,86px);top:50%;transform:translateY(-50%);text-align:right}
.cap.right p{margin-left:auto}
.cap.low{left:50%;bottom:clamp(90px,14vh,150px);transform:translateX(-50%);text-align:center;width:min(640px,86vw);max-width:none}
.cap.low p{margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto}
@media(max-width:760px){
  .cap.left,.cap.right{left:24px;right:24px;text-align:left;max-width:none}
  .cap.right p{margin-left:0}
  .cap .eyebrow{font-size:17.5px;letter-spacing:.09em;word-spacing:.2em;line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:16px}
  .cap:not(.center) .eyebrow{font-size:20px;letter-spacing:.07em;word-spacing:.18em;line-height:1.55;margin-bottom:16px}
  .cap{padding:30px 24px}
  .cap h1{font-size:clamp(28px,7.6vw,42px)}
  .cap p{font-size:21px;line-height:1.66;max-width:none}
}
.hint{position:absolute;left:50%;bottom:clamp(26px,5vh,46px);transform:translateX(-50%);z-index:4;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:14.5px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:.38em;text-indent:.42em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#F0F6FF;text-shadow:0 1px 4px rgba(2,6,14,.95),0 2px 18px rgba(2,6,14,.9);display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:13px;transition:opacity .5s}
.hint .word{padding:7px 16px;border:1px solid rgba(143,184,242,.34);border-radius:999px;background:rgba(3,8,18,.42)}
.hint .bar{width:2px;height:56px;position:relative;overflow:hidden;background:linear-gradient(to bottom,rgba(79,209,224,.28),rgba(79,209,224,0))}
.hint .bar::after{content:"";position:absolute;left:0;width:100%;height:20px;background:linear-gradient(to bottom,rgba(79,209,224,0),var(--vital));animation:hintdrop 2.1s cubic-bezier(.5,0,.5,1) infinite}
@keyframes hintdrop{0%{top:-22px}70%,100%{top:56px}}
.hint .chev{width:26px;height:15px;color:var(--vital);margin-top:-4px;animation:hintnudge 2.1s ease-in-out infinite;filter:drop-shadow(0 1px 8px rgba(2,6,14,.9))}
@keyframes hintnudge{0%,55%,100%{transform:translateY(0);opacity:.55}75%{transform:translateY(5px);opacity:1}}
@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){
  .hint .bar::after{animation:none;top:36px}
  .hint .chev{animation:none;opacity:1}
}
/* vertical scroll progress */
.vprog{position:fixed;right:26px;top:50%;transform:translateY(-50%);z-index:70;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:12px;opacity:0;transition:opacity .4s}
.vprog.on{opacity:1}
.vprog .rail{width:2px;height:150px;background:rgba(143,184,242,.16);position:relative}
.vprog .fill{position:absolute;top:0;left:0;width:100%;height:0;background:var(--vital)}
.vprog .num{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:12px;color:var(--mute);letter-spacing:.1em;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}
@media(max-width:1000px){.vprog{display:none}}

/* ---------- ECG DIVIDER ---------- */
.ecg{display:block;width:100%;height:56px;background:var(--ink)}
.ecg polyline{fill:none;stroke:var(--vital);stroke-width:1.4;opacity:.85;stroke-dasharray:1400;stroke-dashoffset:1400;animation:trace 6s linear infinite}
@keyframes trace{to{stroke-dashoffset:-1400}}
@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ecg polyline{animation:none;stroke-dashoffset:0}}

/* ---------- GENERIC SECTIONS ---------- */
main{position:relative;z-index:5;background:var(--ink)}
section{padding:clamp(50px,7vh,84px) clamp(20px,5vw,44px)}
section[id],footer[id]{scroll-margin-top:96px}
@media(max-width:520px){section[id],footer[id]{scroll-margin-top:78px}}
.wrap{max-width:var(--wrap);margin:0 auto}
.kicker{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.3em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--vital);margin-bottom:14px}
.lead{font-size:clamp(30px,3.8vw,46px);line-height:1.18;max-width:20ch}
.sub{margin-top:16px;font-size:19px;line-height:1.72;color:#C9D6E8;max-width:58ch}

/* full-bleed band image */
.band{margin:0;position:relative;width:100%;height:clamp(300px,58vh,620px);overflow:hidden;background:var(--ink)}
.band img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;display:block}
.band::after{content:"";position:absolute;inset:0;pointer-events:none;background:
  linear-gradient(to bottom,rgba(5,10,20,.4) 0%,rgba(5,10,20,0) 16%,rgba(5,10,20,0) 84%,rgba(5,10,20,.4) 100%)}

/* process — a real sequence, so it is numbered */
.steps{margin-top:38px;display:flex;flex-direction:column}
.step{display:grid;grid-template-columns:76px 1fr;gap:clamp(18px,4vw,52px);padding:24px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line);align-items:start}
.step:last-child{border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
.step .n{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:14px;color:var(--blue);letter-spacing:.14em;padding-top:6px;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}
.step h3{font-size:clamp(22px,2.5vw,29px);line-height:1.26}
.step p{margin-top:11px;font-size:17.5px;line-height:1.74;color:#C9D6E8;max-width:60ch}
@media(max-width:620px){.step{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:6px}}

/* services */
.cards{margin-top:38px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:2px;background:var(--line)}
.card{background:var(--ink-2);display:flex;flex-direction:column}
.card figure{margin:0;aspect-ratio:3/2;overflow:hidden;position:relative;background:var(--navy)}
.card img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;display:block;filter:saturate(.94)}
.card figcaption{position:absolute;left:0;bottom:0;right:0;padding:26px 22px 15px;background:linear-gradient(to top,rgba(5,10,20,.97) 0%,rgba(5,10,20,.82) 40%,rgba(5,10,20,0) 100%);text-shadow:0 1px 6px rgba(3,8,18,.9);font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11.5px;letter-spacing:.22em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--vital)}
.card .body{padding:26px 22px 30px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;flex:1}
.card h3{font-size:26px;line-height:1.22}
.card p{font-size:17px;line-height:1.72;color:#C9D6E8}
@media(max-width:900px){.cards{grid-template-columns:1fr}.card figure{aspect-ratio:16/9}}

/* faq */
.faq{margin-top:36px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:0 clamp(28px,5vw,64px)}
.fq{padding:24px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}
.fq h3{font-size:clamp(21px,2.2vw,26px);line-height:1.3}
.fq p{margin-top:12px;font-size:17.5px;line-height:1.74;color:#C9D6E8;max-width:50ch}
@media(max-width:820px){.faq{grid-template-columns:1fr}}

/* footer */
footer{background:var(--ink-2);border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding:clamp(50px,7vh,80px) clamp(20px,5vw,44px) 34px}
.pgrid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1.02fr;gap:clamp(34px,6vw,76px);align-items:center}
.pgrid .sub{max-width:44ch}
@media(max-width:900px){.pgrid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:30px;align-items:start}}
.fgrid{max-width:var(--wrap);margin:0 auto;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:clamp(30px,6vw,76px);align-items:start}
.fcontact{padding-top:6px}
@media(max-width:860px){.fgrid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:28px}.fcontact{padding-top:0}}
.fgrid h2{font-size:clamp(28px,3.3vw,40px);line-height:1.18}
.fgrid .sub{margin-top:16px}
.contactlist{margin-top:26px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:11px;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:15px;color:#C9D6E8}
.contactlist a{color:var(--sky);text-decoration:none}
.contactlist a:hover{color:var(--paper)}

/* contact buttons */
.ctarow{margin-top:30px;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px}
.ctarow a{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;text-decoration:none;font-family:var(--sans);font-size:17px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:.01em;padding:16px 24px;border:1px solid transparent;transition:background .25s,border-color .25s,color .25s}
.ctarow svg{width:20px;height:20px;flex:none}
.btn-primary{background:var(--blue);color:#fff;border-color:var(--blue);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}
.btn-primary svg{fill:#fff}
.btn-primary:hover{background:#1F58C9;border-color:#1F58C9}
.btn-ghost{background:transparent;color:var(--paper);border-color:rgba(143,184,242,.34)}
.btn-ghost svg{fill:var(--sky)}
.btn-ghost:hover{border-color:var(--sky);background:rgba(143,184,242,.08)}

/* ---- quote card (light instrument panel) ---- */
.qwrap{position:relative;padding-top:16px}
.qbadge{position:absolute;top:0;right:6px;z-index:2;width:76px;height:76px;border-radius:22px;background:linear-gradient(160deg,#3D77E8,#2154C4);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;box-shadow:0 14px 30px rgba(11,30,70,.5)}
.qbadge svg{width:34px;height:34px;fill:#fff}
.qcard{background:#F1F3F6;border-radius:22px;padding:clamp(26px,3.4vw,38px);box-shadow:0 24px 60px rgba(2,7,18,.55)}
.qcard h3{font-family:var(--sans);font-weight:600;font-size:clamp(28px,3.1vw,35px);color:#141A26;letter-spacing:-.02em;line-height:1.15}
.qsub{margin-top:9px;font-size:18px;color:#4E5A6B;font-weight:400}
.qsub b{color:var(--blue);font-weight:600}
.qcard form{margin-top:26px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px}
.qfield{display:flex;flex-direction:column;min-width:0}
.qcard label{font-family:var(--sans);font-size:13.5px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.05em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#37414F;margin-bottom:8px}
.qinput{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #E1E5EB;border-radius:12px;padding:0 14px;transition:border-color .2s,box-shadow .2s}
.qinput:focus-within{border-color:var(--blue);box-shadow:0 0 0 3px rgba(46,107,224,.16)}
.qicon{width:21px;height:21px;flex:none}
.qicon.blue{fill:var(--blue)}
.qicon.green{fill:#1FA463}
.qcard input{flex:1;min-width:0;width:100%;background:transparent;border:0;outline:none;font-family:var(--sans);font-size:17.5px;font-weight:400;color:#141A26;padding:16px 0}
.qcard input::placeholder{color:#798496}
.qrow{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:14px}
@media(max-width:400px){.qrow{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
.qcard button{margin-top:6px;width:100%;font-family:var(--sans);font-size:19px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.01em;padding:21px 24px;background:#141A26;color:#fff;border:0;border-radius:12px;cursor:pointer;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:12px;transition:background .25s}
.qcard button:hover{background:#232D40}
.qnote{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#59626F}
.fbottom{max-width:var(--wrap);margin:40px auto 0;padding-top:22px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);font-family:var(--mono);font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.08em;color:#8395AE;text-transform:uppercase}

/* ---- corpi di lettura su mobile: solo il contenuto, i contatti restano com'erano ---- */
@media(max-width:760px){
  main .kicker{font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.24em;margin-bottom:12px}
  main .lead{font-size:clamp(32px,8.2vw,40px);line-height:1.2;max-width:none}
  main .sub{font-size:20px;line-height:1.75;max-width:none}
  .step{padding:26px 0}
  .step .n{font-size:13px;padding-top:2px}
  .step h3{font-size:26px;line-height:1.28}
  .step p{margin-top:13px;font-size:19.5px;line-height:1.72;max-width:none}
  .card .body{padding:24px 22px 30px;gap:13px}
  .card h3{font-size:28px}
  .card p{font-size:19px;line-height:1.72}
  .card figcaption{font-size:12.5px;letter-spacing:.2em}
  .fq{padding:26px 0}
  .fq h3{font-size:25px;line-height:1.28}
  .fq p{margin-top:13px;font-size:19.5px;line-height:1.74;max-width:none}
  /* il badge calcolatrice non deve coprire il titolo su schermi stretti */
  .fgrid h2{font-size:clamp(28px,7.8vw,36px)}
  .contactlist{font-size:16px;gap:12px}
  .ctarow{gap:11px}
  .ctarow a{font-size:18px;padding:17px 22px;width:100%;justify-content:center}
  .qcard h3{font-size:29px}
  .qsub{font-size:19px}
  .qcard label{font-size:14px}
  .qcard input{font-size:18px;padding:17px 0}
  .qcard button{font-size:20px;padding:22px 24px}
  .qnote{font-size:13px}
  .fbottom{font-size:12.5px}
  .qwrap{padding-top:38px}
  .qbadge{width:62px;height:62px;border-radius:18px}
  .qbadge svg{width:28px;height:28px}
}

@media(max-width:520px){
  header{padding:14px 16px;gap:10px}
  .logo{font-size:17.5px}
  .logo i{font-size:9px;letter-spacing:.18em;margin-top:2px}
  .cta{font-size:13.5px;padding:11px 14px;letter-spacing:0}
}
</style>
</head>
<body>


<div id="loader">
  <div class="ld-mark"><b>LifeCare</b> <span>Italia</span></div>
  <div class="ld-sub">Medical Flight</div>
  <div class="ld-rail"><div class="ld-fill" id="ldFill"></div></div>
  <div class="ld-pct" id="ldPct">00%</div>
</div>

<header id="hdr">
  <a class="logo" href="#film"><b>LifeCare</b> Italia<i>Medical Flight</i></a>
  <nav>
    <a href="#percorso">Come funziona</a>
    <a href="#servizi">Servizi</a>
    <a href="#contatti">Contatti</a>
    <a class="cta" href="#preventivo">Richiedi un preventivo</a>
  </nav>
</header>

<div class="vprog" id="vprog">
  <div class="num" id="vnum">01</div>
  <div class="rail"><div class="fill" id="vfill"></div></div>
  <div class="num">06</div>
</div>

<div id="film">
  <div class="pin">
    <canvas id="seq"></canvas>
    <div class="vignette"></div>

    <div class="cap center" id="c1" style="opacity:1">
      <div class="eyebrow">Voli sanitari&nbsp;&nbsp; Rimpatri&nbsp;&nbsp; Trasferimenti</div>
      <h1>Ci prendiamo cura dei tuoi cari fino a casa.</h1>
      <p>Trasporto sanitario su voli di linea, con barella aeronautica ed équipe medica a bordo. Ovunque si trovino nel mondo.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="cap left" id="c2">
      <div class="eyebrow">Rete di linea</div>
      <h2>Non serve un aereo privato per volare in sicurezza</h2>
      <p>Usiamo i voli di linea già programmati: più rotte disponibili, tempi di partenza più rapidi, costi che restano sostenibili per la famiglia.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="cap right" id="c3">
      <div class="eyebrow">A bordo</div>
      <h2>Una cabina che diventa reparto</h2>
      <p>La barella aeronautica viene installata su due file di sedili in fondo alla cabina, isolata da una tenda divisoria. Il paziente viaggia disteso, in uno spazio riservato.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="cap left" id="c4">
      <div class="eyebrow">Équipe</div>
      <h2>Nessuno viaggia da solo</h2>
      <p>Medico e infermiere accompagnano il paziente per l'intera durata del volo. Per i casi che non richiedono personale medico, un assistente sanitario dedicato.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="cap right" id="c5">
      <div class="eyebrow">Monitoraggio</div>
      <h2>Parametri sotto controllo, minuto per minuto</h2>
      <p>Monitor multiparametrico, ossigeno e presidi di emergenza restano attivi dal decollo all'atterraggio.</p>
